{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36902","headline":"秦望山僧院 · 罗隐","name":"秦望山僧院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巉巉危岫倚沧洲，闻说秦皇亦此游。\n霸主卷衣才二世，老僧传锡已千秋。\n阴崖水赖松梢直，藓壁苔侵画像愁。\n各是病来俱未了，莫将烦恼问汤休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}